OL,4,CHarry Styles, Billie Eilish, Sam       
OL,5,CFender and Cher to headline            
OL,6,CGlastonbury 2027                       
OL,7,GHarry Styles will make his Glastonbury 
OL,8,Gfestival debut next year as one of the 
OL,9,Gevent's headliners, alongside Sam      
OL,10,GFender and Billie Eilish - with Cher   
OL,11,Gamong the other stars on the bill.     
OL,13,FThe veteran US pop icon will play the  
OL,14,Fcoveted Sunday afternoon "legends"     
OL,15,Fslot, which is often considered a      
OL,16,Ffourth headline set. It will be her    
OL,17,Fonly UK festival appearance of the     
OL,18,Fyear.                                  
